SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Track and drivetrain assembly
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=412382
DESCRIPTION:Hands-on build session where the CropSCOUT team assembles the robot's track drivetrain. We'll mount the drive sprockets and tension wheels to the undercarriage, fit the rubber tracks onto the chassis, and set proper track tension and alignment. Bring gloves — no prior robotics experience needed, just a willingness to turn wrenches.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=412382
END:VEVENT
