UID:66b61a81258c07bfb7b8a39d2c4a295a1082026_12:19:16_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:ICPC Rocky Mountain Regionals
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=416958
DESCRIPTION:Join ACM at ASU, SoDA, the School of Mathematical and Statistical Sciences, and School of Computing and Augmented Intelligence as Arizona State University proudly serves as an official host site for the ICPC Rocky Mountain Regional Contest! Known as the "Olympics of college coding," the International Collegiate Programming Contest (ICPC) challenges teams of three to solve complex, real-world algorithmic problems under intense time constraints.\n\nCome witness the top engineering, computer science, and math minds from across the region battle the clock in this ultimate test of logic, strategy, and teamwork! Whether you are competing or supporting our Sun Devil teams, don't miss out on the most prestigious competitive programming event of the season.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=416958
END:VEVENT
