UID:63846164bf212b3871e3f03f36e7aab48202026_9:34:22_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Free Entry Tournament - Meccha Chameleon
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=410697
DESCRIPTION:Join the ASU Esports Lounge and the Friends of Esports club for a spooky evening of Meccha Chameleon! Hide and seek with your fellow Sun Devils and put your camouflage skills to the test. The top 3 chameleons will win 3D printed trophies! Halloween costumes are encouraged.\n\nHow It Works\nWe will play 5 preliminary lobbies to allow everyone to accumulate points. As a hider, you will get points for time spent on the seekers' screens and order of being found. As a seeker, you will get points for finding hiders and lose points for hiders who last to the end of the round. After the preliminary lobbies, we will split the group into the championship and consolation lobbies to determine winners.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=410697
END:VEVENT
