UID:b913297dc40819a779ec72369b8df0259192026_10:07:40_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Fil-Am SportsFest
LOCATION:Sun Devil Fitness Center, 400 E Apache Blvd, Tempe 85281, United States
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=414888
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Filipino American Sportsfest, a one-day, Olympic-style event celebrating Philippine Independence Day and the rich heritage of the Filipino American community! This exciting event will feature fun and competitive sports tournaments, cultural activities, and a celebration of community spirit.\nCome together with your family and friends for a day filled with excitement, teamwork, and Filipino pride! Whether you're a seasoned athlete or a supporter, there’s something for everyone.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=414888
END:VEVENT
