UID:777f9efbef8f9a0e7e86bee6a2c278218162026_2:33:08_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Saturday Pracitica
LOCATION:Memorial Union (Sparky's Den), 301 E Orange St., Tempe, AZ 85281, Tempe, AZ 85281, United States
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=409132
DESCRIPTION:The Tango Club at ASU practica is a low pressure environment to practice your tango skills, work on new moves, and learn alongside other tango students! We practice from 11 AM to 2 PM in the basement of the Memorial Union (next to the pool tables). We like to play, have fun and sometimes bring snacks! No partner or experience is required, just come by and have fun!\n\nAlso there's free parking nearby on the second floor of 1000 S. McAllister Ave! \n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=409132
END:VEVENT
