UID:524a7c3528b766298fb6640f636a709f8172026_7:11:36_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Saturday Night Worship Service
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=409435
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a welcoming Christian Church service with a meal and fun times to follow! All faiths are welcome, and we promise a good time with new friends, delicious food, and some games!\nRides will be provided from Tempe campus (just let us know you need one)... departing at the Sun Devil Campus Store (ASU Bookstore) promptly at 5pm. Or take the Valley Metro bus with Aaron! Meet Aaron at the Tyler St./Rural Rd. (University Dr./Rural Rd. transit area) bus stop at 4:30pm SHARP to catch the 4:40pm bus to Arizona Community Church, located at 9325 S. Rural Road, Tempe, AZ.\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=409435
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
